{title: Cows of Bashan}
{subtitle: Amos 4:1–3}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 71}
{time: 2/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | ×9

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Hear this word, you cows of Bashan
Living on Mount [C][Dm]Samaria
You oppress [C]the poor and crush [Bb]the needy
Saying, [C]Bring us something to [Dm]drink
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The Lord GOD has sworn [C]by his holi[Dm]ness
Days are coming [C]upon [Dm]you
You will be carried [C]off with [Bb]hooks
The last of [C]you with fish[Dm]hooks
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]You will go out [Dm]through breaches in the wall
[C]Each woman straight a[Dm]head of her
[Bb]You will be cast out toward [Dm]Harmon
De[C]clares the LORD, the end is [Dm]near
{end_of_verse}
